{"id": "22-4306-2-18", "zh": "当 o、a 词尾省略时，这些形式与 tumha、amha 连用时也同样成立：aguṃ、agiṃsu、agaṃsu。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "22-4306-19-85", "zh": "Samantā vijjutā āguṃ（闪电从四面而来）〔本生 2.22.2264〕；tepā’guṃ samitiṃ vanaṃ（他们来到林中的集会）〔待查〕；visesaṃ ajjhagaṃsu te（他们证得了殊胜）〔长部 2.354〕；asesaṃ parinibbanti, asesaṃ dukkhamajjhaguṃ（他们无余般涅槃，彻底超越了苦）〔如是语 93〕；sabbaṃ dukkhaṃ upajjhaguṃ（他们超越了一切苦）〔无碍解道 1.236；中部 3.271〕。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-4306-86-113", "zh": "ajjhago、ajjhaga、ajjhagi、ajjhaguttha、ajjhagiṃ、ajjhagimhā、ajjhagumhā、agā、āgā、anvagā、ajjhagā、upajjhagā、agū、āgū。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-4306-114-141", "zh": "Āgū devā yasassino（有名望的诸天来了）〔长部 2.340〕；cittassa ekadhammassa, sabbeva vasamanvagū（一切都随从心这一法的支配）〔相应部 1.61〕。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4306-142-158", "zh": "Cetā haniṃsu vedabbaṃ, sabbe te byasanamajjhagū（车提人杀了韦达巴，他们全都遭遇了灾祸）〔本生 1.1.48〕。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4307-2-14", "zh": "在完成过去时（parokkhā）中，词首音节重复，依“kavaggahānaṃ cavaggajā”这条规则，前一个音节的 ka 组辅音变为 ca 组辅音。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4307-15-52", "zh": "例如 so jagama（他去了）；依大规则，倒数第二个元音变长；有时 a 变为 i，如圣典中有“rājā dudīpo jagāmi maggan”一句〔本生 2.22.911；另本作“rājā dudīpopi jagāma saggaṃ”〕。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-4307-53-61", "zh": "so jagāma，te jagāmu，tvaṃ jagame。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-4308-2-31", "zh": "在以辅音起首的词尾前插入 i：tumhe jagamittha，ahaṃ jagamaṃ，mayaṃ jagamimha，so jagamittha，te jagamire，tvaṃ jagamittho，tumhe jagamivho，ahaṃ jagamiṃ，mayaṃ jagamimhe。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4309-2-7", "zh": "在 ssati 等词尾中：gamissati、gamissanti、gamissare。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-4310-2-21", "zh": "在后一组（为自言）词尾中：so gamissate，te gamissante、gamissare，tvaṃ gamissase，tumhe gamissavhe，ahaṃ gamissaṃ，mayaṃ gamissāmhe。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-4311-2-6", "zh": "在 ssā 等词尾中：so agamissā、gamissā。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-4312-2-25", "zh": "依“āīūmhāssāssāmhānaṃ vā”这条规则，ssā 与 ssāmha 变为短音：agamissa、gamissa，te agamissaṃsu、gamissaṃsu，tvaṃ agamisse、gamisse。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4313-2-32", "zh": "依“eyyāthasse”等规则，sse 变为 a：tvaṃ agamissa、gamissa，tumhe agamissatha、gamissatha，ahaṃ agamissaṃ、gamissaṃ，mayaṃ agamissāmhā、gamissāmhā、agamissāmha、gamissāmha。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4314-2-16", "zh": "依“gama vada dānaṃ ghammavajjadajjā”这条规则，在一切词尾中 gama 变为 ghamma：ghammati、ghammanti。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4315-2-5", "zh": "被动语态中：ghammīyati、ghammīyanti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-4316-2-22", "zh": "依大规则，也可以替换为 gaggha：tvaṃ yena yeneva gagghasi, phāsuṃyeva gagghasi（你无论去到哪里，都安乐地去）〔增支部 8.63〕。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4317-2-19", "zh": "依“gamayamisāsadisānaṃ vācchaṅa”这条规则，在一切词尾中 gama 的 m 变为 ccha：gacchati、gacchanti、gacchare。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4318-2-11", "zh": "被动语态中：gacchīyati、gacchīyanti、gacchiyyati、gacchiyyanti、gacchiyyare。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-4319-2-5", "zh": "使役中：gacchāpeti、gacchāpayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-4319-6-13", "zh": "gacchatu、gacchantu、gaccheyya、gaccheyyuṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-4320-2-9", "zh": "依“eyyuṃssuṃ”这条规则，eyyuṃ 变为 uṃ：gacchuṃ。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4321-2-23", "zh": "依“eyyeyyāseyyaṃnaṃ ṭe”这条规则，eyya、eyyāsi、eyyaṃ 这几个词尾变为 e：so gacche，tvaṃ gacche，ahaṃ gacche。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4322-2-11", "zh": "依“eyyāthasse”等规则，eyyātha 变为 o：tumhe gaccheyyātho。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4323-2-10", "zh": "在 ā 等词尾中：agacchā、gacchā，或者 agaccha、gaccha。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4324-2-13", "zh": "在 ī 等词尾中：agacchi、gacchi，agacchuṃ、gacchuṃ，agacchiṃsu、gacchiṃsu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-4325-2-28", "zh": "645. ḍaṃsa 的末尾辅音也变为 ñcha〔迦旃延文法 517；色成就 488；词义指南 1105；多数版本作“chaṅa”〕。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-4326-2-11", "zh": "在 ā 等词尾与 ī 等词尾中，ḍaṃsa 的末尾辅音也变为 ñcha。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4327-2-6", "zh": "so agañchā、gañchā。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-4327-7-11", "zh": "同样还有：agañchū、gacchū。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4328-2-6", "zh": "在 ī 等词尾中：so agañchi、gañchi。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-4329-2-15", "zh": "Tasmiṃ paṭipaviṭṭhamhi, añño āgañchi brāhmaṇo（他回去之后，另一位婆罗门来了）〔经集 985〕。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4329-16-31", "zh": "Khippameva upāgañchi, yattha sammati temiyo（他很快就来到帖米亚所住的地方）〔本生 2.22.73〕。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4329-32-36", "zh": "te agañchuṃ、gañchuṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-4330-2-7", "zh": "在 ssati 等词尾中：gacchissati、gacchissanti、gacchissare。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-4331-2-27", "zh": "646. labha、vasa、chida、gama、bhida、ruda 变为 ccha〔迦旃延文法 481；色成就 524；词义指南 966、968〕。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4332-2-33", "zh": "在带 ssa 的词尾中，这些词根的末音可以连同 ssa 一起变为 ccha；依对规则的拆分，susa 也适用，如圣典中有“nadīva avasucchatī”（就像河流干涸）一句〔本生 2.22.2140〕。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-4333-2-41", "zh": "lacchati、labhissati，alacchā、alabhissā，vacchati、vasissati，avacchā、avasissā，checchati、chindissati，acchecchā、acchindissā，bhecchati、bhindissati，abhecchā、abhindissā，rucchati、rodissati，arucchā、arodissā。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4334-2-24", "zh": "依这条规则，在带 ssa 的两类词尾中，gama 的 m 连同 ssa 一起变为 ccha：gacchati、gacchissati，gacchanti、gacchissanti，ahaṃ gacchaṃ、gacchissaṃ。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4335-2-58", "zh": "这里有如下圣典文句：gacchaṃ pāraṃ samuddassa, kassaṃ purisakāriyaṃ（我将渡到大海彼岸，将做大丈夫该做的事）〔本生 2.22.131〕；tassāhaṃ santikaṃ gacchaṃ, so me satthā bhavissati（我将到他那里去，他将成为我的导师）；sabbāni abhisambhossaṃ, gacchaññeva rathesabha（这一切我都能承受，车中雄牛啊，我一定要去）〔本生 2.22.1832〕；vedhabyaṃ kaṭukaṃ loke, gacchaññeva rathesabha（在世间守寡是痛苦的，车中雄牛啊，我一定要去）〔本生 2.22.1835〕。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-4336-2-9", "zh": "在 ssā 等词尾中：agacchā、agacchissā，agacchaṃsu、agacchissaṃsu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-4337-2-3", "zh": "jara，义为年岁衰减——", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4338-2-26", "zh": "647. jara、sada 可加插音 īma〔迦旃延文法 505、609；色成就 482、484；词义指南 1018、1213〕。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-4339-2-10", "zh": "jara、sada 的元音之后可以加插音 īma，所以这里加了插音 īma。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-4340-2-5", "zh": "jīrati、jīranti。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "22-4341-2-5", "zh": "使役中：jīrāpeti、jīrāpayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-4342-2-27", "zh": "648. jara、mara 变为 iya〔迦旃延文法 505；色成就 482；词义指南 1018；多数版本作“…mīyaṅa”〕。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-4343-2-12", "zh": "在 nta、māna、ti 等词尾中，这两个词根可以变为 iya。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4344-2-5", "zh": "jiyati、jiyanti。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "22-4345-2-5", "zh": "元音变长时：jīyati、jīyanti。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4346-2-5", "zh": "辅音重复时：jiyyati、jiyyanti。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4347-2-5", "zh": "使役中：jiyāpeti、jiyāpayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-4348-2-28", "zh": "janī，义为出现；依大规则，在一切词尾中 n 替换为 y，词首元音变长：jāyati、upajāyati、vijāyati、jāyanti、jāyare、pajāyanti、pajāyare、upajāyanti、upajāyare。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4349-2-13", "zh": "使役中不加强元音：janeti、janenti、janayati、janayanti。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4350-2-13", "zh": "被动语态中：janīyati、janīyanti；jāyatu、jāyantu、jāyeyya、jāyeyyuṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4351-2-9", "zh": "使役中：janeyya、janeyyuṃ、janayeyya、janayeyyuṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-4352-2-14", "zh": "在 ī 等词尾中：ajāyi、ajāyiṃsu、vijāyi、vijāyiṃsu，或者 ajani、jani。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4353-2-21", "zh": "使役中：ajanesi、janesi、ajanayi、janayi、ajanesuṃ、janesuṃ、ajanayuṃ、janayuṃ、ajanayiṃsu、janayiṃsu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-4354-2-5", "zh": "在 ssati 等词尾中：jāyissati、vijāyissati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-4355-2-5", "zh": "在 ssā 等词尾中：ajāyissā、jāyissā。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-4356-2-7", "zh": "ḍaṃsa，义为咬：ḍaṃsati、ḍaṃsanti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-4357-2-9", "zh": "使役中：ḍaṃseti、ḍaṃsayati、ḍaṃsāpeti、ḍaṃsāpayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-4358-2-23", "zh": "在 ā 等与 ī 等词尾中，适用“ḍaṃsassa ca ñchaṅa”这条规则，并省略鼻音（niggahīta）：aḍañchā、ḍañchā、aḍañchi、ḍañchi。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4359-2-7", "zh": "daha，义为燃烧：dahati、dahanti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-4360-2-16", "zh": "在被动语态中带 ya 时，依“hassa vipallāso”这条规则，前后两个音互换位置：agginā gāmo dayhati（村子被火焚烧），dayhanti。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4361-2-9", "zh": "使役中：dāheti、dāhayati、dahāpeti、dahāpayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-4362-2-29", "zh": "649. daha 的 d 变为 ḍ〔迦旃延文法 20；色成就 27；词义指南 50；多数版本作“…dasadadakkhā”〕。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-4363-2-7", "zh": "daha 这个词根的 d 可以变为 ḍ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4364-2-5", "zh": "ḍahati、ḍahanti。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "22-4365-2-8", "zh": "disa，义为观看；加上 ti 等词尾，在主动语态中加 la。", "confidence": 70}
